{
  "info": {
    "name": "Vocali Transcriber API",
    "description": "Flujo completo de transcripcion batch: subir audio -> lanzar job -> listar historial -> descargar. Usa el environment 'Vocali Transcriber - dev' (variable idToken debe rellenarse a mano con el ID token de Cognito, no el access token: el authorizer nativo COGNITO_USER_POOLS de API Gateway solo acepta el ID token). Todas las peticiones fuerzan HTTP/1.1 (protocolProfileBehavior.protocolVersion) porque esta API, servida detras de CloudFront, devuelve 403 AccessDeniedException cuando Postman negocia HTTP/2.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Get upload URL",
      "protocolProfileBehavior": { "protocolVersion": "http1" },
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"contentType\": \"audio/mpeg\"\n}"
        },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transcriptions/upload-url", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["transcriptions", "upload-url"] }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.environment.set('uploadUrl', body.uploadUrl);",
              "pm.environment.set('audioKey', body.key);",
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('devuelve uploadUrl y key', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(body.uploadUrl).to.be.a('string');",
              "  pm.expect(body.key).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Upload audio to S3",
      "protocolProfileBehavior": { "protocolVersion": "http1" },
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "audio/mpeg" }],
        "body": { "mode": "file", "file": {} },
        "url": { "raw": "{{uploadUrl}}", "host": ["{{uploadUrl}}"] },
        "description": "IMPORTANTE: en la pestana Body, selecciona un fichero de audio real (mp3/wav) en el campo 'file'. No lleva Authorization: la propia URL prefirmada de S3 ya autentica la subida. El Content-Type debe ser audio/mpeg (el mismo que se pidio en el paso 1) o S3 respondera 403 SignatureDoesNotMatch."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Start batch transcription",
      "protocolProfileBehavior": { "protocolVersion": "http1" },
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"audioKey\": \"{{audioKey}}\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transcriptions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["transcriptions"] }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.environment.set('transcriptionId', body.transcriptionId);",
              "pm.test('status 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
              "pm.test('status PROCESSING', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('PROCESSING'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. List history",
      "protocolProfileBehavior": { "protocolVersion": "http1" },
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transcriptions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["transcriptions"] }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Download transcription",
      "protocolProfileBehavior": { "protocolVersion": "http1" },
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transcriptions/{{transcriptionId}}/download",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["transcriptions", "{{transcriptionId}}", "download"]
        },
        "description": "Da 404 hasta que Speechmatics termine el job y llame al webhook (normalmente unos segundos/minutos, segun la duracion del audio). Reintenta esta peticion."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200 o 404 (si aun no ha terminado)', () => {",
              "  pm.expect([200, 404]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Get realtime token (opcional)",
      "protocolProfileBehavior": { "protocolVersion": "http1" },
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transcriptions/realtime/token",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["transcriptions", "realtime", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Genera un JWT temporal de Speechmatics para tiempo real. Aun no hay nada en el frontend que lo use."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
